// A 2x2 labeled figure for a two-column journal page (17.5 cm wide, auto
// height: the page fits the panels), using the framework
// prelude: page presets, grid, auto "(a)"-"(d)" labels and default spacing.
page("double", grid(2, panels([
    image("a.png"), image("b.png"),
    image("c.png"), image("d.png"),
])))
